のレイヤー分けがされたデータで納品いただけますと幸いです。\n\n⚫参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1-xy767-2JQfc5eO0TLu2B04xxQCcW7Ep", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@drawing410/works/2", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ed08a217/uploads/origins/d37b2dc8-f88a-4d63-9be3-9189dd270f2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff493e6f763c5d73cfe4f13eac7e7f91", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ed08a217/uploads/origins/d37b2dc8-f88a-4d63-9be3-9189dd270f2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ff493e6f763c5d73cfe4f13eac7e7f91, https://si.imgix.net/ed08a217/uploads/origins/d37b2dc8-f88a-4d63-9be3-9189dd270f2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7bc3430a9a0f5e7575eac2021ec69c01 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ed08a217/uploads/origins/d37b2dc8-f88a-4d63-9be3-9189dd270f2c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a22bdacce430eb22542c4beb8aaec2d5 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "はじめまして！\nドルフロのP90ちゃんを可愛く描いていただけませんか？\n服は公式の服装でも、他の服飾でも構いません。\n構図などはお任せします。\nよろしくお願いします。\n\nキャラについて\nhttps://wikiwiki.jp/dolls-fl/P90#f08b27f6\n\n立ち絵\nhttps://iopwiki.com/wiki/P90#Gallery\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/w/P90\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/1/1f/Pic_P90_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/b/bc/Pic_P90_D_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/3/37/Pic_P90_2802_HD.png\nhttps://www.gfwiki.org/images/c/cb/Pic_P90_2802_D_HD.png\nhttps://iopwiki.com/images/c/cb/P90_costume2.png\nhttps://iopwiki.com/images/7/76/P90_costume2_D.png", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@drawing410/works/1", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f0268fa0/uploads/origins/327fd8bc-6106-4ece-9a80-b5df96018be3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=5aa5efb3d3bda1ad3bb72ce4605c0b87", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f0268fa0/uploads/origins/327fd8bc-6106-4ece-9a80-b5df96018be3?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompre